, system installation, and maintenance. Whether you're an aspiring solar technician or a professional looking to upskill, Certified PV Associate equips you with the knowledge and practical experience needed for the growing renewable energy industry. Start your training today!", "short_description": "Learn the fundamentals of solar energy with Certified PV Associate! This immersive VR training app provides hands-on experience with PV system components and different types of photovoltaic systems. Train in a realistic virtual environment to enhance technical expertise, improve safety awareness, and develop the skills needed for a successful career in the solar energy industry."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Immerselearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7345558678901642"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "968565098117756"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "968565098117756"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1739336760, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "968565098117756"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "bin